# (build 100) The Escape menu's FULLSCREEN item. On the title Escape opens
# the menu (the game frozen under it); down three stops is FULLSCREEN, C
# turns it on and C again off; B closes the menu. The route reads its own
# settings.json (none, so windowed), never the player's. The PNGs are the
# menu as the window draws it (game_overlay); the fullscreen switch itself
# is the SDL3 platform's and cannot be seen headless. The waits put
# the shots in the lamp's lit half of its blink.
start new
wait screen title
press esc
expect escape-menu open
expect setting fullscreen off
shot menu_open
press down
press down
press down
wait ticks 12
shot menu_fullscreen_off
press c
expect setting fullscreen on
wait ticks 12
shot menu_fullscreen_on
press c
expect setting fullscreen off
press b
expect escape-menu closed
expect screen title
